# Everything this suite writes, which is now beside the suite rather than
# beside the subject. These rules have to live here: repo-autosync commits
# whatever is untracked in this repository, so an unignored artifact is an
# artifact committed back in.
#
# crontab.* is the one to keep in mind. run-tests.sh dumps the REAL user
# crontab to crontab.before to prove it put it back unchanged, and this is a
# public repository.
crontab.*
pass*.out
settings.after*.json
fake-crontab.txt
stage/
.testhome/
# run-edge-cases.sh builds one fake HOME per case at .edge-<case>. No rule
# covered these before the suite moved; they were untracked and visible.
.edge-*/
__pycache__/
